TITLE: Atomic Arithmetic

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ZEP-SRS-37-4
STATUS: Draft
TYPE: Functional
COMPONENT: Atomic Operations
TITLE: Atomic add
STATEMENT: >>>
The Zephyr RTOS shall provide an interface to atomically add a value to an atomic
variable and return the variable's previous value.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ZEP-SYRS-29

