UID: ZEP-SRS-37-6
STATUS: Draft
TYPE: Functional
COMPONENT: Atomic Operations
TITLE: Atomic increment
STATEMENT: >>>
The Zephyr RTOS shall provide an interface to atomically increment an atomic variable
by one and return its previous value.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ZEP-SYRS-29

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ZEP-SRS-37-7
STATUS: Draft
TYPE: Functional
COMPONENT: Atomic Operations
TITLE: Atomic decrement
STATEMENT: >>>
The Zephyr RTOS shall provide an interface to atomically decrement an atomic variable
by one and return its previous value.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ZEP-SYRS-29

